00:19:41.505 --> 00:19:43.029
Best friend?

00:19:45.075 --> 00:19:47.703
Thou and thee, what time it be?

00:19:47.978 --> 00:19:48.945
Tomo?!

00:19:48.945 --> 00:19:52.108
Mafuyu asked me for help,
wanting to cheer you up.

00:19:52.516 --> 00:19:56.976
But in the end, it was ME
who came to the rescue!

00:20:01.324 --> 00:20:09.459
Alexander Nikolaevich Hell, do you
pledge to honor Mafuyu Oribe for life?

00:20:11.801 --> 00:20:13.428
W-Well...

00:20:13.803 --> 00:20:16.294
Lack of objection indicates "Yes."

00:20:16.673 --> 00:20:23.442
Mafuyu Oribe, do you pledge to honor
Alexander Nikolaevich Hell for life?

00:20:24.614 --> 00:20:26.275
M-Mafuyu...

00:20:33.723 --> 00:20:35.918
I... I d...

00:20:37.527 --> 00:20:38.858
I object!

00:20:45.502 --> 00:20:51.031
Though I am still single,
a little girl like YOU gets married?

00:20:51.474 --> 00:20:52.702
What a sham.

00:20:52.876 --> 00:20:54.144
Big Ma'am!

00:20:54.144 --> 00:21:00.549
So sorry that the cute Miss Mafuyu became a
Maria, seemed about to be another ME.

00:21:00.717 --> 00:21:02.617
Why are you here?

00:21:02.719 --> 00:21:05.779
Well, I wish we'd talked about this earlier.

00:21:06.223 --> 00:21:09.852
As of today, she's been transferred
here as a new sister.

00:21:12.229 --> 00:21:14.060
Listen up, you little chicks!

00:21:14.264 --> 00:21:18.530
Now that I'm here, I'll strike aside
this gloomy atmosphere of yours.

00:21:18.735 --> 00:21:20.498
Huh?!

00:21:20.837 --> 00:21:24.329
You shall tremble and kneel in fear.

00:21:48.365 --> 00:21:54.771
Unstable, an asymmetrical trajectory

00:21:54.771 --> 00:22:01.278
Irises shaded in prelude

00:22:01.278 --> 00:22:07.550
The light's terminal line remains distorted

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:13.113
And deceives the visualized dream

00:22:14.991 --> 00:22:20.397
In that dark, fictional abyss

00:22:20.397 --> 00:22:26.469
Someday, smash through the imprisoned world

00:22:26.469 --> 00:22:28.438
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:28.438 --> 00:22:30.106
And you will die in your sin

00:22:30.106 --> 00:22:33.310
Slice the cross, is the voice that recites

00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:36.946
A poem of awakening to an absent god

00:22:36.946 --> 00:22:39.783
The blade of sacrilege?

00:22:39.783 --> 00:22:41.351
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:41.351 --> 00:22:43.019
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:43.019 --> 00:22:46.790
An oratorio with you, who have been cut off

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:49.659
Sorrow is illuminated by the moon

00:22:49.659 --> 00:22:55.256
An eve that leads to a sparkling blue tomorrow

00:23:09.946 --> 00:23:10.780
Next Episode

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:13.717
Mafuyu, can you live in happiness..?

00:23:13.717 --> 00:23:15.285
Stop talking in broken Japanese.

00:23:15.285 --> 00:23:16.820
Wait, that's not important!

00:23:16.820 --> 00:23:18.981
Big Ma'am is here on campus!

00:23:19.489 --> 00:23:21.024
Things seem like they'll get busy, huh?

00:23:21.024 --> 00:23:22.325
This is a real turn of events.

00:23:22.325 --> 00:23:24.494
There's no way things can stay peaceful!

00:23:24.494 --> 00:23:28.198
Next time on Qwaser of Stigmata II,
"Qwa*ser of Stigmata"

00:23:28.198 --> 00:23:31.568
Qwa*ser of Stigmata

00:23:31.568 --> 00:23:34.170
Tremble! Kneel down in fear!

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:34.864
Qwa*ser of Stigmata
